WEBVTT

01:40.759 --> 01:45.650
[Love in Pavilion]

01:46.240 --> 01:50.620
[Episode 32]

02:19.800 --> 02:21.079
Qingmu Yuan.

02:21.960 --> 02:23.960
Let me take you to Zhang Zheng.

02:59.750 --> 03:01.030
Yuan.

03:07.920 --> 03:08.790
Yuan!

03:12.800 --> 03:13.750
Yuan!

03:20.700 --> 03:21.579
Yuan!

03:59.190 --> 03:59.990
What's wrong?

04:00.730 --> 04:02.960
Don't you know whose grave this is?

04:04.340 --> 04:08.070
Don't you remember? You buried him with your own hands.

04:12.440 --> 04:15.350
You took everything from him yourself—

04:16.620 --> 04:19.550
his identity, his reputation,

04:19.709 --> 04:22.590
and even the woman

04:22.870 --> 04:24.950
he loved most.

04:25.770 --> 04:28.230
You are truly wicked.

04:28.420 --> 04:29.850
What you're saying...

04:31.270 --> 04:32.620
isn't true!

04:37.140 --> 04:39.890
Look, your crimes are already

04:40.090 --> 04:42.860
engraved on this unmarked tombstone.

04:47.170 --> 04:48.850
[Give Me Back My Life]

04:50.820 --> 04:51.950
Was it you...

04:53.190 --> 04:54.409
who killed him?

04:54.510 --> 04:55.940
Yes, I killed him.

04:56.070 --> 04:57.920
You don't really think

04:57.950 --> 05:00.090
Qingmu Yuan loved you, do you?

05:01.310 --> 05:04.890
How could you kill such a good person like him?

05:04.910 --> 05:07.730
You've been scheming to become him,

05:07.920 --> 05:09.310
but you'll always

05:09.310 --> 05:11.800
just be a dirty, lowly stray dog.

05:12.310 --> 05:13.920
Your only way out

05:14.040 --> 05:16.130
is submitting to the darkness.

05:16.190 --> 05:18.820
Anaran, be true to yourself.

05:45.280 --> 05:49.090
The Dark Sword became famous through malicious energy.

05:50.159 --> 05:52.470
Forget all about being

05:52.490 --> 05:54.290
friendly and loving.

05:54.630 --> 05:58.159
Come with me and kill them all.

06:45.270 --> 06:46.430
Anaran,

06:47.340 --> 06:49.820
come with me to kill them.

06:52.870 --> 06:54.780
Young Master lived an upright life,

06:54.780 --> 06:56.380
carefree and unrestrained.

06:57.240 --> 06:58.650
He won't blame me.

07:00.340 --> 07:01.360
As for me...

07:10.060 --> 07:12.060
I've never been anyone else.

07:15.240 --> 07:17.300
A gentleman should be like an orchid.

07:18.200 --> 07:19.600
How could I, Zhang Zheng,

07:21.390 --> 07:23.720
possibly associate with the likes of you?

07:29.120 --> 07:31.240
You presumptuous idiot.

07:44.220 --> 07:47.110
You think you can fight me?

07:47.250 --> 07:49.400
Look who I've brought with me.

07:57.430 --> 07:58.070
Yuan!

08:37.030 --> 08:37.720
Yuan.

08:37.970 --> 08:38.870
Wake up!

09:09.360 --> 09:12.000
A dirty, lowly stray dog

09:12.020 --> 09:14.420
still dreaming of making a name for itself.

09:14.750 --> 09:15.870
Qingmu Yuan,

09:16.200 --> 09:17.150
kill him.

09:23.670 --> 09:24.670
Classmate Zhang.

09:49.360 --> 09:50.520
Zhang Zheng.

09:50.750 --> 09:52.760
Dying at the hands of Qingmu Yuan

09:52.870 --> 09:56.270
is the best end for you.

09:56.790 --> 09:58.460
As long as you die,

09:58.600 --> 10:00.120
Qingmu Yuan's heart

10:00.200 --> 10:02.720
will also remain in the darkness forever.

10:13.910 --> 10:15.550
Classmate Zhang.

10:17.150 --> 10:18.390
I don't want to...

10:20.790 --> 10:21.790
say...

10:23.380 --> 10:25.570
goodbye to you.

10:38.210 --> 10:39.120
Yuan.

11:02.960 --> 11:04.200
Black Fox.

11:08.500 --> 11:11.230
Don't even think of getting your hands on my Yuan.

11:28.720 --> 11:29.440
No...

11:42.030 --> 11:42.840
Yuan.

11:47.240 --> 11:48.340
Don't be afraid.

12:04.970 --> 12:06.780
I'll get you out of here.

12:08.770 --> 12:10.810
♪ How can the wind stop? ♪

12:11.400 --> 12:13.740
♪ How can clouds stop for us? ♪

12:14.530 --> 12:18.080
♪ The vicissitudes of life never cease ♪

12:19.040 --> 12:23.720
♪ The time we spend together is too short and unreal ♪

12:21.440 --> 12:22.370
Don't be afraid.

12:22.580 --> 12:23.910
I'll get you out of here.

12:24.670 --> 12:28.690
♪ You blur into a shadow near me ♪

12:29.780 --> 12:31.780
♪ We're fully committed ♪

12:32.320 --> 12:34.260
♪ We're wholly devoted ♪

12:35.140 --> 12:39.030
♪ Love has us spellbound ♪

12:37.520 --> 12:39.200
Some things from our youth

12:39.490 --> 12:41.950
♪ We're lost in a wasteland ♪

12:40.170 --> 12:42.170
last a lifetime.

12:42.430 --> 12:44.660
♪ A lonely boat lies around ♪

12:42.740 --> 12:43.770
I like it.

12:45.700 --> 12:49.790
♪ To the moon I tell how much I miss you ♪

12:46.370 --> 12:47.440
What do you like?

12:50.200 --> 12:51.550
I like Qingmu Yuan.

12:51.990 --> 12:56.430
♪ My passion for you never fades ♪

12:57.070 --> 12:59.630
♪ It's a guardian angel ♪

13:00.090 --> 13:02.050
♪ Hovering high in the sky ♪

13:02.820 --> 13:04.950
♪ Time goes by ♪

13:05.320 --> 13:07.340
♪ Stars twinkle and dim ♪

13:08.040 --> 13:11.570
♪ But our love remains still ♪

13:13.000 --> 13:17.380
♪ I'll give away my everything ♪

13:18.280 --> 13:20.670
♪ In exchange for a life of joy for you ♪

13:21.550 --> 13:23.450
♪ There can be many new chapters in my life ♪

13:23.980 --> 13:25.620
♪ But everywhere I see ♪

13:26.390 --> 13:28.130
♪ Your image sticks around ♪

13:28.830 --> 13:32.420
♪ Holding your hands, I can't speak a word ♪

13:38.510 --> 13:39.510
I don't blame you.

13:43.480 --> 13:44.880
I really don't.

13:48.090 --> 13:49.350
But Yuan,

13:50.260 --> 13:51.780
you must remember...

13:54.310 --> 13:56.240
♪ We're fully committed ♪

13:55.010 --> 13:57.030
never be controlled by her again.

13:56.780 --> 13:58.760
♪ We're wholly devoted ♪

13:59.980 --> 14:03.620
♪ Love has us spellbound ♪

14:02.090 --> 14:03.370
We...

14:04.080 --> 14:06.460
♪ We're lost in a wasteland ♪

14:07.250 --> 14:09.150
♪ A lonely boat lies around ♪

14:07.460 --> 14:09.260
will definitely win.

14:10.400 --> 14:14.520
♪ To the moon I tell how much I miss you ♪

14:13.250 --> 14:14.410
Right?

14:16.530 --> 14:20.970
♪ My passion for you never fades ♪

14:21.710 --> 14:24.200
♪ It's a guardian angel ♪

14:24.710 --> 14:26.680
♪ Hovering high in the sky ♪

14:27.480 --> 14:29.440
♪ Time goes by ♪

14:30.030 --> 14:31.950
♪ Stars twinkle and dim ♪

14:32.660 --> 14:36.130
♪ But our love remains still ♪

14:37.610 --> 14:41.990
♪ I'll give away my everything ♪

14:42.740 --> 14:45.140
♪ In exchange for a life of joy for you ♪

14:45.690 --> 14:47.810
♪ There can be many new chapters in my life ♪

14:48.200 --> 14:50.210
♪ But everywhere I see ♪

14:50.740 --> 14:52.610
♪ Your image sticks around ♪

14:53.290 --> 14:56.530
♪ Holding your hands, I can't speak a word ♪

15:09.440 --> 15:10.490
Qingmu Yuan.

15:11.260 --> 15:13.460
You even killed Zhang Zheng.

15:13.600 --> 15:14.550
What's left

15:14.550 --> 15:16.550
in this world for you?

15:17.910 --> 15:21.240
Come with me to kill the rest of the Mask Group.

15:19.780 --> 15:23.910
♪ I'll give away my everything ♪

15:22.890 --> 15:25.570
Let's destroy this world.

15:25.130 --> 15:27.360
♪ In exchange for a life of joy for you ♪

15:28.030 --> 15:30.040
♪ There can be many new chapters in my life ♪

15:30.700 --> 15:32.370
♪ The past vanishes ♪

15:32.870 --> 15:34.720
♪ Like a dream and a whiff of smoke ♪

15:35.480 --> 15:39.370
♪ I hope to see you again in the next life, if there is one ♪

16:40.140 --> 16:41.240
What?

16:41.590 --> 16:43.570
Even you want to defy me?

16:51.770 --> 16:53.380
Today, I, Qingmu Yuan,

16:53.790 --> 16:56.650
will fight you to the death to set things right.

17:02.500 --> 17:06.560
Like a mantis trying to stop a chariot, you're destined for destruction.

17:13.030 --> 17:15.400
You actually used your life force to empower the magical artifact?

17:15.400 --> 17:16.819
Do you have a death wish?

17:31.310 --> 17:34.460
Your deaths are completely worthless.

17:34.680 --> 17:35.880
Idiots.

18:27.640 --> 18:29.020
Classmate Zhang.

18:33.570 --> 18:35.030
I'm coming.

18:54.160 --> 18:56.000
Zhang Zheng, am I beautiful?

18:56.640 --> 18:58.070
Do you like me?

18:58.720 --> 19:00.070
Why do you like me?

19:00.650 --> 19:02.540
When did you start liking me?

19:02.570 --> 19:04.100
The woman traveling with me

19:04.370 --> 19:06.030
is beautiful like a hibiscus.

19:06.960 --> 19:08.690
Her body light as a flying bird,

19:08.790 --> 19:11.050
her jade pendants jingling pleasantly.

19:11.160 --> 19:12.730
Oh, beautiful girl,

19:13.790 --> 19:15.790
your reputation is unforgettable.

19:24.060 --> 19:26.290
Zizai, where are we?

19:26.510 --> 19:28.050
How did we get here?

19:35.140 --> 19:37.000
Have you found where everyone is?

19:41.030 --> 19:41.770
This way, I think.

19:41.770 --> 19:42.220
Okay.

20:00.440 --> 20:01.970
Quzhuo, what are you doing?

20:02.000 --> 20:02.510
Coming!

20:03.550 --> 20:04.550
Quzhuo, careful!

20:06.110 --> 20:06.790
Quzhuo!

20:07.720 --> 20:09.380
Quzhuo, come out now!

20:10.040 --> 20:10.780
Zizai.

20:12.000 --> 20:12.440
Zizai!

20:14.740 --> 20:15.630
Zizai!

20:49.550 --> 20:50.540
Old fox demon.

20:50.760 --> 20:51.890
Where's my brother?

20:53.160 --> 20:54.890
Just like you,

20:55.030 --> 20:57.000
he's trapped in another illusion.

20:59.670 --> 21:01.670
You'd better worry about yourself.

21:05.370 --> 21:06.630
Li Zizai,

21:06.660 --> 21:08.490
your resistance is futile.

21:09.300 --> 21:11.600
You two must die here today.

21:16.470 --> 21:18.060
Li Quzhuo.

21:18.370 --> 21:20.530
The magical artifacts Zizai made back then,

21:20.530 --> 21:22.130
how do they compare to yours?

21:24.250 --> 21:26.650
Your magical artifact is already perfect.

21:27.040 --> 21:28.160
Impressive.

21:28.790 --> 21:29.770
It's still not as perfect

21:29.770 --> 21:31.820
as the purple-gold gourd you made.

21:32.150 --> 21:33.240
Your magical artifacts

21:33.240 --> 21:34.700
are unparalleled!

21:35.980 --> 21:39.040
Li Zizai's magical artifacts are the best in the world,

21:39.040 --> 21:41.120
yet he suddenly chose talismans.

21:41.250 --> 21:43.460
Was it really because he liked them?

21:44.910 --> 21:46.230
Li Quzhuo,

21:46.310 --> 21:48.200
you secretly joined the Mask Group,

21:48.200 --> 21:50.050
claiming to have a chivalrous heart.

21:50.050 --> 21:52.560
But do you really have the ability to save others?

21:52.560 --> 21:55.270
You were almost killed by the Rakshasa bird demons.

21:55.270 --> 21:56.910
Have you forgotten?

21:57.680 --> 21:59.510
Servant, is the medicine here?

21:59.550 --> 22:00.200
Coming!

22:00.200 --> 22:00.860
Move aside.

22:01.310 --> 22:02.070
Move aside!

22:07.880 --> 22:08.590
Quzhuo.

22:10.070 --> 22:10.680
Quzhuo.

22:12.640 --> 22:12.920
Zizai...

22:12.920 --> 22:13.980
Where are you hurt?

22:14.510 --> 22:15.510
Zizai...

22:16.550 --> 22:17.030
I...

22:17.640 --> 22:19.220
Today, alone...

22:19.790 --> 22:20.550
I...

22:21.590 --> 22:24.550
fought against the entire Rakshasa bird demon clan.

22:31.350 --> 22:33.280
The Rakshasa bird demon poison...

22:35.090 --> 22:37.740
Li Quzhuo, do you know

22:37.760 --> 22:39.720
who ultimately cleaned up after

22:39.790 --> 22:41.640
your so-called heroic acts?

22:42.940 --> 22:46.080
Do you know what price he paid for this?

22:47.450 --> 22:48.690
What price?

23:04.680 --> 23:06.210
Hand over the antidote,

23:06.670 --> 23:09.070
or I'll raze your Snow Ravine to the ground.

23:12.070 --> 23:15.110
Kill me, and your brother must die.

23:16.030 --> 23:17.290
You should have a taste

23:17.350 --> 23:19.530
of losing a loved one too.

23:19.590 --> 23:21.590
What will it take for you to save him?

23:21.680 --> 23:23.400
If you want to save your brother,

23:23.400 --> 23:26.730
you'll have to trade it with your most precious possession.

23:27.440 --> 23:28.680
Eldest Son of the Li family,

23:28.680 --> 23:30.880
your magical artifacts are unrivaled.

23:31.350 --> 23:33.280
Your most precious possession

23:33.440 --> 23:35.720
should be your hands, am I right?

23:40.520 --> 23:42.440
Your brother exchanged his right hand

23:42.440 --> 23:43.880
for your life.

23:44.850 --> 23:47.850
What he loved most in his life were magical artifacts.

23:48.750 --> 23:50.680
He gave up his lifelong pursuit.

23:51.500 --> 23:53.400
How agonizing must that be?

24:03.770 --> 24:05.240
Li Quzhuo,

24:05.650 --> 24:07.530
you really deserve to die.

24:14.340 --> 24:15.910
Li Quzhuo,

24:16.310 --> 24:18.340
you only drag others down.

24:18.960 --> 24:20.680
Who needs a loser

24:20.680 --> 24:22.530
like you?

24:23.640 --> 24:25.240
Who needs a loser

24:28.540 --> 24:30.110
like me?

24:31.570 --> 24:32.890
Li Quzhuo,

24:34.400 --> 24:37.080
your brother lost his right hand because of you.

24:37.630 --> 24:41.220
Don't you think you should give him something in return?

24:47.400 --> 24:48.510
Yes.

24:56.790 --> 24:58.380
What I owe my brother...

25:03.310 --> 25:04.400
I'll repay it.

25:25.200 --> 25:26.240
Quzhuo.

25:26.510 --> 25:27.440
Wake up!

25:36.400 --> 25:37.070
Zizai!

25:41.440 --> 25:42.510
Quzhuo!

25:42.590 --> 25:44.110
Li Quzhuo.

25:46.440 --> 25:47.640
Li Zizai.

25:47.660 --> 25:50.520
You've always wanted to protect your brother.

25:50.730 --> 25:52.680
I'll let you witness him die

25:52.680 --> 25:54.510
in front of you today.

26:06.880 --> 26:08.050
Zizai. Zizai.

26:08.110 --> 26:08.830
Quzhuo.

26:11.830 --> 26:12.510
Zizai.

26:13.030 --> 26:13.830
Quzhuo.

26:14.550 --> 26:15.960
My legs...

26:17.720 --> 26:18.950
Quzhuo.

26:19.350 --> 26:21.210
I promise I'll get you out of here.

26:27.340 --> 26:28.740
Li Zizai.

26:29.920 --> 26:31.920
Do you still think you have a way out?

26:32.720 --> 26:33.680
Can you take

26:33.680 --> 26:35.920
your crippled brother out of here?

26:36.570 --> 26:37.980
Dream on.

26:38.550 --> 26:40.810
Just stay here with your useless brother

26:41.070 --> 26:42.690
and die here.

26:49.790 --> 26:50.570
Zizai.

26:50.680 --> 26:51.200
Zizai!

26:53.000 --> 26:54.030
I said...

26:55.440 --> 26:56.510
no one...

26:58.240 --> 27:00.070
can mess with my brother!

27:16.270 --> 27:18.310
You're as useless as your brother.

27:38.550 --> 27:39.310
Zizai.

27:40.400 --> 27:41.870
Didn't you say

27:42.350 --> 27:43.690
that in this world,

27:43.920 --> 27:46.290
talismans are yang, vessels are yin,

27:46.680 --> 27:49.080
and humans are vessels of heaven and earth?

27:49.580 --> 27:51.040
♪ Like a dream, like reality, like a fantasy ♪

27:50.870 --> 27:53.190
If I use my body as a vessel

27:51.800 --> 27:53.840
♪ At dawn and dusk ♪

27:53.720 --> 27:56.330
to refine all your talismans,

27:56.260 --> 27:57.790
♪ One person, one glance, one instant ♪

27:57.400 --> 27:58.730
we'll be

27:58.420 --> 28:00.610
♪ Stop time in the beginning ♪

27:59.740 --> 28:02.640
able to beat her with the yin and yang of heaven and earth!

28:01.890 --> 28:03.750
♪ Time interlaces or somersaults ♪

28:04.310 --> 28:05.550
What do you mean?

28:05.210 --> 28:07.860
♪ Despite ups and downs, I'll never let you down ♪

28:06.960 --> 28:07.830
Zizai!

28:08.810 --> 28:12.750
♪ Follow the shadow and look out for each other in the clouds ♪

28:15.260 --> 28:17.390
You must get out of here alive.

28:15.440 --> 28:16.880
♪ There's infatuation, there's love, there's hate ♪

28:17.520 --> 28:20.290
♪ Lies are hard to understand ♪

28:18.200 --> 28:19.400
I said before...

28:21.300 --> 28:23.220
that I can protect you too.

28:21.770 --> 28:23.390
♪ We won't argue ♪

28:24.150 --> 28:26.390
♪ Faintly reflecting the beginning ♪

28:27.590 --> 28:29.850
♪ Burn out the chains of darkness ♪

28:31.010 --> 28:33.700
♪ In this life, I will do all to face it with you ♪

28:32.560 --> 28:34.530
I'm already crippled anyway.

28:34.420 --> 28:38.560
♪ Having agreed to grow old together, we now head home ♪

28:34.640 --> 28:36.700
There's no point in getting out.

28:36.730 --> 28:37.850
Today,

28:38.160 --> 28:40.530
let's draw upon the power of heaven and earth

28:40.530 --> 28:41.930
♪ The long-cherished wish of this lifetime ♪

28:40.530 --> 28:42.920
and fight violence with violence!

28:42.530 --> 28:44.010
♪ The meaning of the world ♪

28:44.560 --> 28:47.100
♪ Follow the light, changing with the stars ♪

28:47.670 --> 28:50.300
♪ No regrets about my fate; resolute joy ♪

28:51.040 --> 28:53.890
♪ To search for the edge of the world ♪

28:53.080 --> 28:53.950
Quzhuo!

28:54.640 --> 28:56.770
♪ Born of affection, sustained by love ♪

28:56.270 --> 28:57.000
Zizai!

28:57.510 --> 28:58.350
Come on!

28:57.670 --> 28:59.910
♪ Our vows will never fade ♪

29:00.550 --> 29:04.950
♪ My heart will never change ♪

29:03.200 --> 29:04.270
One begets two,

29:05.320 --> 29:06.910
two begets three,

29:07.200 --> 29:08.790
three begets all things.

29:10.660 --> 29:14.320
All things and all living beings,

29:14.830 --> 29:15.550
merge!

29:19.920 --> 29:22.990
You think self-destructing your spirit can hurt me?

29:23.030 --> 29:24.240
How dumb.

29:30.990 --> 29:32.680
♪ There's infatuation, there's love, there's hate ♪

29:33.290 --> 29:35.580
♪ Lies are hard to understand ♪

29:37.600 --> 29:39.100
♪ We won't argue ♪

29:39.920 --> 29:42.230
♪ Faintly reflecting the beginning ♪

29:43.060 --> 29:45.200
♪ Burn out the chains of darkness ♪

29:46.320 --> 29:49.290
♪ In this life, I will do all to face it with you ♪

29:50.530 --> 29:54.950
♪ Having agreed to grow old together, we now head home ♪

29:56.010 --> 29:57.660
♪ The long-cherished wish of this lifetime ♪

29:57.790 --> 29:59.680
Turn evil into good

29:58.310 --> 29:59.730
♪ The meaning of the world ♪

30:00.230 --> 30:02.730
♪ Follow the light, changing with the stars ♪

30:00.240 --> 30:02.070
like dust with light.

30:02.720 --> 30:05.200
Break off all the stars in the world.

30:03.610 --> 30:06.020
♪ No regrets about my fate; resolute joy ♪

30:06.740 --> 30:09.580
♪ To search for the edge of the world ♪

30:07.850 --> 30:09.910
Zizai, leave!

30:10.160 --> 30:12.490
♪ Born of affection, sustained by love ♪

30:11.440 --> 30:12.440
Descend!

30:13.240 --> 30:15.690
♪ Our vows will never fade ♪

30:16.450 --> 30:22.270
♪ My heart will never change ♪

30:25.230 --> 30:26.800
♪ Memories float up ♪

30:27.310 --> 30:28.700
♪ Clearly illuminated ♪

30:29.300 --> 30:31.800
♪ Follow the light and bid farewell to meet again ♪

30:32.580 --> 30:35.120
♪ The passion unchanged, the devotion unbroken ♪

30:35.780 --> 30:38.700
♪ To break through the dark boundary ♪

30:37.160 --> 30:37.920
Zizai...

30:39.170 --> 30:41.510
♪ The deep love is like fire ♪

30:42.380 --> 30:44.760
♪ Swear to reverse the prophecy and ending ♪

30:45.300 --> 30:50.190
♪ My heart will burn through the eternal night ♪

30:52.150 --> 30:59.190
♪ My heart remains bright for you ♪

30:59.570 --> 31:00.780
I need a drop of your blood

31:00.780 --> 31:02.730
to make a new talisman.

31:03.710 --> 31:04.580
You must swear

31:04.610 --> 31:07.310
to wear this talisman every day,

31:07.460 --> 31:08.840
never taking it off.

31:09.560 --> 31:11.350
Was I too reckless?

31:14.460 --> 31:17.060
Did the Rakshasa bird demon give you trouble?

31:17.720 --> 31:18.980
Indeed, you were rash.

31:21.600 --> 31:22.790
But in this world,

31:22.820 --> 31:25.620
if it weren't for you, the reckless hero Li Quzhuo,

31:26.070 --> 31:27.530
all those villagers

31:29.130 --> 31:30.790
would probably be dead by now.

31:32.880 --> 31:33.880
Zizai.

31:34.050 --> 31:37.600
We just sacrificed some magical artifacts and talismans.

31:38.270 --> 31:39.880
Our family's wealthy and prosperous.

31:39.880 --> 31:40.810
We can afford it.

31:42.020 --> 31:43.460
Besides, who am I?

31:43.680 --> 31:45.420
A petty demon

31:45.640 --> 31:46.970
can't do anything to me.

31:49.790 --> 31:50.810
Really?

31:53.670 --> 31:55.110
If I make the vow,

31:55.110 --> 31:57.110
will you join the Mask Group with me?

31:59.610 --> 32:01.590
I, Li Quzhuo, swear

32:01.880 --> 32:04.030
I'll keep this life-saving talisman

32:04.030 --> 32:06.440
with me at all times, never letting it leave my side.

32:06.440 --> 32:08.510
How's that? Am I clever or what?

32:08.510 --> 32:10.000
Life-saving talisman!

32:11.440 --> 32:12.940
I guessed it right!

32:18.770 --> 32:20.770
This isn't a life-saving talisman.

32:24.640 --> 32:26.570
It's a life-exchanging talisman.

32:29.340 --> 32:30.600
Silly little brother,

32:31.560 --> 32:33.710
go ahead and protect this world.

32:34.720 --> 32:35.550
Descend.

32:36.250 --> 32:37.820
I'll protect you.

32:42.720 --> 32:43.270
Zizai...

32:46.200 --> 32:48.160
Zizai!

33:33.780 --> 33:35.250
Black Grief Tree?

33:38.060 --> 33:39.750
Yitan, Zui,

33:40.060 --> 33:40.740
it's me!

33:41.270 --> 33:41.920
Qiyue!

33:48.360 --> 33:49.820
My brother's paper crane.

33:49.960 --> 33:51.560
Let's hear what he has to say.

33:54.550 --> 33:55.440
Yitan!

34:05.670 --> 34:06.750
Stop, Yitan!

34:06.750 --> 34:08.010
What's wrong with you?

34:48.110 --> 34:49.800
You promised to go bird egg hunting with me,

34:49.800 --> 34:50.860
but you stood me up.

34:51.110 --> 34:52.150
Is composing couplets

34:52.150 --> 34:53.610
with the teacher that fun?

34:53.840 --> 34:56.070
Taking bird eggs is wrong.

34:56.190 --> 34:58.520
A gentleman should be upright and proper.

34:58.590 --> 35:00.990
We shouldn't steal eggs from mother birds.

35:01.070 --> 35:01.960
Besides,

35:02.110 --> 35:04.920
Cousin doesn't care that much about his face.

35:05.000 --> 35:05.630
You...

35:06.440 --> 35:08.880
Look at him! Who did he learn all this from?

35:10.320 --> 35:11.440
Ignore what your mother said.

35:11.440 --> 35:12.760
Go on, go play.

35:13.150 --> 35:14.280
Thank you, Daddy.

35:16.440 --> 35:17.640
Why'd you take a book?

35:27.840 --> 35:28.510
Is it sweet?

35:28.510 --> 35:29.030
Yes.

35:29.990 --> 35:31.000
So from now on,

35:31.070 --> 35:33.280
will you still argue with me?

35:34.150 --> 35:35.030
Of course not.

35:39.430 --> 35:40.350
Oh, right.

35:40.800 --> 35:42.230
Where's my little nephew?

35:42.230 --> 35:44.440
Why haven't I seen him today?

35:45.710 --> 35:46.680
Who knows?

35:47.190 --> 35:49.320
He's probably off playing somewhere.

35:50.480 --> 35:52.340
What about my father and brother?

35:54.690 --> 35:55.920
At this hour...

35:56.360 --> 35:59.160
Practicing swordsmanship in the back mountains?

36:02.710 --> 36:03.230
Here.

36:08.840 --> 36:10.570
These grapes are really sweet.

36:12.230 --> 36:13.150
I hope

36:13.800 --> 36:15.440
this dream never ends.

36:24.510 --> 36:25.510
Weird.

36:26.670 --> 36:30.030
Why did I say this is a dream?

36:33.510 --> 36:34.150
Wait.

36:36.150 --> 36:37.840
My father is already gone.

36:51.320 --> 36:52.000
Zui.

36:53.520 --> 36:54.630
This is not a dream.

36:56.360 --> 36:57.590
This is our future.

37:02.840 --> 37:03.710
Yes,

37:05.150 --> 37:06.510
this is our future.

37:09.280 --> 37:11.210
The future I've always dreamed of.

37:21.230 --> 37:23.230
Even if the whole world betrays you,

37:25.480 --> 37:26.730
I, Yang Yitan, won't.

37:37.610 --> 37:40.590
Wangquan Zui, wake up.

37:40.960 --> 37:42.660
This is all an illusion.

38:34.170 --> 38:36.040
Yang Yitan.

38:42.800 --> 38:44.230
When did you fall

38:45.250 --> 38:46.910
under the Black Fox's spell?

38:47.000 --> 38:48.590
When I killed Yang Huanzhou

38:50.020 --> 38:51.530
to save you.

39:08.350 --> 39:10.230
Because of my immense hatred,

39:10.430 --> 39:11.920
the Black Fox's power

39:12.290 --> 39:13.930
entered my Clairvoyant Eye.

39:14.880 --> 39:16.320
So...

39:17.630 --> 39:19.110
you became like this

39:20.240 --> 39:21.480
because of me?

39:21.510 --> 39:22.190
Yes!

39:23.340 --> 39:25.020
Justice and righteousness?

39:26.180 --> 39:28.010
They're all fake.

39:29.560 --> 39:32.150
Only the strong decide the fate of the weak.

39:32.970 --> 39:35.330
That's the truth of this world.

39:36.230 --> 39:38.230
Why should we sacrifice ourselves?

39:39.570 --> 39:41.340
Why should we go against fate?

39:44.130 --> 39:45.130
Let go of me!

39:46.000 --> 39:46.930
Instead,

39:49.260 --> 39:51.490
let's conquer this world.

39:52.110 --> 39:54.510
Who cares about right or wrong, good or evil?

39:54.510 --> 39:56.340
Let's do whatever we want

39:57.340 --> 39:58.390
and get...

40:00.810 --> 40:02.580
whoever we want.

40:09.000 --> 40:10.450
Who are you, really?

40:16.230 --> 40:17.590
Have you forgotten

40:18.760 --> 40:21.250
why he activated his Clairvoyance in the first place?

40:21.250 --> 40:23.320
It was because you were in danger.

40:25.490 --> 40:28.130
Why did he kill his own grandfather?

40:28.380 --> 40:29.840
It was also because of you.

40:30.820 --> 40:32.360
From beginning to end,

40:32.870 --> 40:35.150
it's all because he chose you.

40:36.120 --> 40:37.430
Wangquan Zui,

40:38.000 --> 40:40.710
you're flawless and pure.

40:41.800 --> 40:43.170
But think about it,

40:43.200 --> 40:45.860
who has been protecting you so you stay that way?

40:47.250 --> 40:48.520
Do you regret it?

40:48.990 --> 40:50.350
Do you blame yourself?

40:51.710 --> 40:56.020
How many people in this world love you as he does?

40:56.230 --> 40:58.780
He can't turn back now.

40:59.510 --> 41:02.800
Why don't you join him?

41:12.300 --> 41:13.300
Qiyue!

41:28.880 --> 41:30.030
Qiyue!

41:36.360 --> 41:39.510
Yitan, I need to save Qiyue!

41:45.800 --> 41:47.150
Daddy.

41:54.180 --> 41:55.700
Qiyue!

42:01.510 --> 42:02.770
Deng Qiyue,

42:04.210 --> 42:05.640
your daughter

42:05.920 --> 42:09.230
will never see you return as a hero.

42:47.360 --> 42:48.230
Qiyue!

42:48.230 --> 42:49.110
No!
